config JD79653
	bool "JD79653 compatible display controller driver"
	depends on SPI
	help
	  Enable driver for the JD79653 (GoodDisplay GDEW0154M09) EPD controller.
	  Ported from weteor's ZMK fork to the current Zephyr display/SPI/GPIO API
	  (mirrors ZMK's in-tree il0323 driver).
